WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.059
Ablations confirm each choice.

00:00:02.139 --> 00:00:08.620
Combining three aggregation degrees works best:
small neighborhoods catch tiny VisA defects,

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:11.116
large ones catch big MVTec defects.

00:00:11.196 --> 00:00:16.108
Averaging the smallest thirty percent interval
beats the max or range,

00:00:16.188 --> 00:00:19.674
lifting AUROC to ninety-seven point eight percent.

00:00:19.754 --> 00:00:24.880
Re-scoring raises VisA image AUROC from ninety to
ninety-two point eight.
